flowchart LR
  EX[Expert<br/>Authentic expertise] --> DEMO[1. Demonstrate<br/>Video / audio / context]
  DEMO --> UND[2. Understand<br/>Actions • conditions • cues • exceptions]
  UND --> GND[3. Ground<br/>Claims linked to source evidence]
  GND --> LES[4. Teach<br/>Concise, source-grounded lesson]
  LES --> BASE[Baseline<br/>Learner attempt]
  BASE --> PRACT[5. Practice<br/>Real or simulated task]
  PRACT --> ATT1[Observed attempt<br/>Video / audio / image / text]
  ATT1 --> VER[6. Verify<br/>Rubric + reference evidence]
  VER --> FB[Evidence-linked feedback<br/>Strengths • gaps • next step]
  FB --> RETRY[Retry]
  RETRY --> ATT2[Observed second attempt]
  ATT2 --> MEAS[Measured change<br/>Criterion-level improvement]
  MEAS --> TX[7. Evolve<br/>Transmission record + lineage]
  TX --> NEXT[Future learner / adaptation]
  NEXT -. new evidence .-> UND
  SRC[(Source evidence<br/>immutable / provenance)] -. supports .-> GND
  SRC -. supports .-> VER
  RUB[(Skill-specific rubric)] -. defines criteria .-> VER

  subgraph TRUST[Trust boundary]
    SRC
    GND
    VER
    RUB
  end

  classDef human fill:#eef4ff,stroke:#3b82f6,color:#12203a
  classDef ai fill:#eefbf5,stroke:#22a06b,color:#12203a
  classDef evidence fill:#fff5e8,stroke:#f59e0b,color:#12203a
  classDef outcome fill:#f2edff,stroke:#7c3aed,color:#12203a
  class EX,BASE,PRACT,NEXT human
  class UND,LES,FB,MEAS ai
  class DEMO,GND,ATT1,ATT2,SRC,RUB evidence
  class VER,RETRY,TX outcome
  style TRUST fill:#fafafa,stroke:#b7c2d6,stroke-dasharray:5 5